{"title": "Coin Cuirass (Condition)", "pageid": 34312, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Coin_Cuirass_(Condition)", "categories": ["Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Gold_Pile_Medium_Item_Icon.png/30px-Gold_Pile_Medium_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d3/Gold_Pile_Medium_Item_Icon.png/45px-Gold_Pile_Medium_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d3/Gold_Pile_Medium_Item_Icon.png/60px-Gold_Pile_Medium_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gold Pile Medium Item Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Gold_Pile_Medium_Item_Icon.png/30px-Gold_Pile_Medium_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d3/Gold_Pile_Medium_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Coin Cuirass</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Cursed coins have gathered around the Toll Collector's chest, increasing her overall health by 100. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>UID: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">TWN_TOLLHOUSE_BUFF_05</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:TWN_TOLLHOUSE_BUFF_05+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:TWN_TOLLHOUSE_BUFF_05+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The fifth <a href=\"/wiki/Grim_Visage\" title=\"Grim Visage\">Grim Visage</a> destroyed will remove this piece of armour.</li>\n<li>Alternatively, this condition will be removed after Gerringothe Thorm is reduced to less than 107 hit points.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creatures_with_Coin_Cuirass\">Creatures with Coin Cuirass</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gerringothe_Thorm\" title=\"Gerringothe Thorm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png/30px-Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png/45px-Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png/60px-Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gerringothe Thorm\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png/30px-Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/24/Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gerringothe_Thorm\" title=\"Gerringothe Thorm\">Gerringothe Thorm</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief 